fc5b5ec1 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのイラストがとても好きで、ぜひうちのオリジナルキャラクターの依頼をお願いしたいと思っています！\n\nキャラクターは女の子と男の子の2人で、どちらも約12歳・身長は同じくらい（約150cm）の仲良しです。また、2人ともトラヴェスティ（クロスドレッシング）が得意です。詳細は下記リンクからご確認いただけます：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LMztJ-ZvXvdNcrV-BYApjg_41kfdek5X\n\n服装についてはご自由に描いていただいて大丈夫です（簡略化やアレンジも歓迎です）。資料はあくまでイメージ・参考としてご覧ください。\n\nお読みいただきありがとうございます！\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。\n\n角兔子", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@takoyaki_osusi/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1331975, "client_id": 667554, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0ab812c6/uploads/origins/747f6b95-b8a8-4541-a588-eb957903ad74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac4fe214ec90cc0010f58ed0d24fd7fa", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0ab812c6/uploads/origins/747f6b95-b8a8-4541-a588-eb957903ad74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac4fe214ec90cc0010f58ed0d24fd7fa, https://si.imgix.net/0ab812c6/uploads/origins/747f6b95-b8a8-4541-a588-eb957903ad74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec8e6de75ccb6ffc97d61a9ce5713645 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0ab812c6/uploads/origins/747f6b95-b8a8-4541-a588-eb957903ad74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ecc58829000e21019dde33690051a30 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0ab812c6/uploads/origins/747f6b95-b8a8-4541-a588-eb957903ad74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3061adb318232debadb0e7e5374e3970", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0ab812c6/uploads/origins/747f6b95-b8a8-4541-a588-eb957903ad74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3061adb318232debadb0e7e5374e3970, https://si.imgix.net/0ab812c6/uploads/origins/747f6b95-b8a8-4541-a588-eb957903ad74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b80cac0b8f6b88739ff1e3051dea5f57 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0ab812c6/uploads/origins/747f6b95-b8a8-4541-a588-eb957903ad74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f85917893e67fb9f41265f8ceb50d537 3x"}, "body": "Hi! I love your illustration so I hope you can draw my two OCs (Blanke & Side). \nReference link: https://sta.sh/24zq05vuqoy\n\n○Characters Introduction \nBlanke (190cm): A vampire who has lived in a hidden mansion for many years. Usually, his expression is indifferent and have few emotional fluctuations. In fact, he hides the side of a child (such as he loves cats and sweets).\nSide (158cm): A specter who has been floating since his death. Often have serious expression, and is implicit tsundere, easy to get lost. He always feels reluctant about some of Blanke's behaviors.\n\n○Request \nPlease draw illustration according to their setting. \n*Optional Element reference: Night mansion, French windows, cemeteries, bats, coffins decorated with flowers, retro streets, Fog city street etc.\n\nThank you so much for considering! It doesn't matter if you feel inappropriate, you can cancel this request.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@takoyaki_osusi/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1331975, "client_id": 2959888, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ab136561/uploads/origins/129fdeff-c340-49fe-8e80-e12626a58740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc7eefacd8be8c99481e8cb64163ba74", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ab136561/uploads/origins/129fdeff-c340-49fe-8e80-e12626a58740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc7eefa